Dialogue: 50,0:00:01.05,0:00:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lesson one.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:02.67,0:00:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An old man and a baby are stranded\Non an island full of deadly predators.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:07.14,0:00:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sail to the island to save them,\Nbut only one person other than you can fit
Dialogue: 50,0:00:11.89,0:00:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on your rescue boat.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umm. Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll get off\Nthe boat and stay there.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.69,0:00:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the baby\Nand old man will fit.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would save them both!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.11,0:00:26.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong answer!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The old geezer's gonna\Ndie soon anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.12,0:00:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So abandon him!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.81,0:00:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.75,0:00:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!\NDon't tell them that!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.79,0:00:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you boys\Nhere in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you join the Navy?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.38,0:00:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something out there\Nworth protecting, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.81,0:00:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.35,0:02:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.78,0:03:27.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooooooooooh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.76,0:03:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uuugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.32,0:06:52.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure you want\Nto do this, Kuzan?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.36,0:07:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.05,0:09:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's like three billion berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.42,0:09:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.32,0:09:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.09,0:13:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I can't sink my claws into that\Nship you've got waiting off the coast?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think I can't sink my claws into that\Nship you've got waiting off the coast?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.10,0:13:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate\Nthe power of my Isle-Isle Fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.43,0:14:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.31,0:18:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.82,0:18:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.12,0:21:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.58,0:21:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.29,0:22:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.48,0:22:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.29,0:23:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.06,0:23:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.15,0:25:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.02,0:26:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.64,0:26:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
