Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.18,0:02:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did\Nthey get so banged up?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.22,0:02:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe a run-in\Nwith some really nasty pirates?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.39,0:02:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess you've never\Nheard of Battleship Bags.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.67,0:02:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Commodore Brannew!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.43,0:02:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What\Nare Battleship Bags?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see those\Nindentations there?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are fist marks\Nfrom someone
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.97,0:02:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,using the armor of the warships\Nas punching bags.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punching bags?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you\Nknow who did it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.18,0:03:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp,\Nstarting when he was young.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.64,0:03:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's kept it up for decades\Nnow. It's his routine.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's still doing it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are\Nthere two of them?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other belonged\Nto Garp's protégé.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.66,0:03:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The former admiral, Aokiji.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.55,0:03:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't use\Nhaki or devil fruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the rule\Nof Battleship Bagging.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.52,0:03:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the strength\Nof a true hero.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.69,0:03:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not something\Nyou're born with.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That punch sent him flying\Nstraight into the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.21,0:03:54.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp's a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.28,0:04:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick! We gotta pull\Nhim out or he's gonna drown!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.11,0:04:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell are\Nwe supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat the boss in one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't fight this guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much,\NVice Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Legendary\NHero for ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save it, boys.\NI'm just gettin' started!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.43,0:04:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Legendary\NHero," my ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.81,0:04:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're nothin' but an old hack\Nwho's been trashin' our hideout.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.36,0:04:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now we're gonna make\Nya pay for the damages.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.91,0:04:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Drunken Spitfire!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.34,0:04:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Fireballs!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.27,0:05:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meowch!\NThat's hot! Stop burning me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.83,0:05:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying\Nto sink the whole island?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.16,0:05:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you maniac!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.68,0:05:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do when\NCommodore Teach comes back?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he sees his base like\Nthis, he'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got\NGarp outnumbered,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.24,0:05:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't even flinch,\Nwhat's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in the clear,\NVice Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The prisoners, our soldiers,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.48,0:05:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and all the injured have been\Nevacuated from the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all aboard\Nthe ship now.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.68,0:05:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good. Nice work.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hibari! Stay strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.19,0:05:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch the frozen ones!\NThaw them slowly!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Koby. Please be safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're ready to set\Noff at any time!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! We're all done here!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.17,0:06:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull back! Koby!\NHelmeppo! Grus, c'mon!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.01,0:06:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.27,0:06:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.60,0:06:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't miss this hellhole,\Nthat's for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place sure\Nlives up to the talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.68,0:06:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You poke a hole anywhere
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and these damn pirates\Nswarm out, one after another.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.66,0:06:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Garp, but like I\Nsaid, I can't let you leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.43,0:06:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've run while\NI still had the chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.07,0:06:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez. I'm dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before we fight,\NI'm your favorite, too, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.67,0:06:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of Blackbeard's\Nofficers are dangerous.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.99,0:06:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have to beat them!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is drag\Nour asses to the coast!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let 'em kill you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.71,0:07:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1002,1053)}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody, help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I must have left\None of the prisoners behind!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness we\Ndidn't set sail without her!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.26,0:07:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby, wait!\NDon't go! It's a trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.43,0:08:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Was he\Ninvisible somehow?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.97,0:08:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shiryu.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.57,0:08:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think Impel Down was\Na better fit for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woo!\NShiryu got him!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.78,0:08:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ran that sword\Nstraight through Iron Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay, Garp?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.68,0:08:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine! Just get\Nback to the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!\NHe got hurt defending me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.90,0:08:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself, Koby!\NI was his target all along.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give up easy,\Ndo you, old man?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.83,0:08:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like Garp's worn down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.55,0:09:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shiryu was just\Nwaiting to make his move!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even normal guys like us\Ncan take him down now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(689,1053)}– Let's go!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.99,0:09:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we gotta\Ndo is finish the old man off
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.08,0:09:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we'll be set for life!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.75,0:09:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp is worth as\Nmuch as an admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.92,0:09:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got a Three-Crown\NBounty! Heh!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.07,0:09:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta\Nmy way, small fries!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.98,0:09:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.53,0:09:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if his hands\Nand feet were tied together,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you still couldn't kill Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.38,0:09:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.77,0:09:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,102)}Ice Glove!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.57,0:10:09.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.17,0:10:15.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I want\Nyou to mentor me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.79,0:10:24.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, I like my freedom.\NGo bother one of the trainers.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.91,0:10:26.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,They've taught\Nme all they can.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.55,0:10:29.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for more.\NPlease, teach me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.58,0:10:32.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I said no! Get lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.93,0:10:49.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!\NDamn, that hurts.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.32,0:10:53.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You better\Nnot use haki!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That won't help ya learn.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know\Nhow to do that yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.12,0:11:04.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Agh! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What is\N"justice" to the Navy?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.20,0:11:49.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know anymore.\NNot after Ohara.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.41,0:11:57.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,My son became\Na Revolutionary!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuzan!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.40,0:12:18.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,My grandson says he\Nwants to be a damned pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.64,0:12:20.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell\Nwould he do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.53,0:12:22.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I have no idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.74,0:12:25.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta eat something.\NWanna join me?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.11,0:12:28.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I have work to do.\NDid you forget I'm an admiral?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.96,0:12:31.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(673.5,1053)}– Tea?\N– Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You trained a powerful\Nenemy for yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.07,0:12:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're expelled. You dunce.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.53,0:13:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.31,0:13:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taught him well after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep him safe,\Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.79,0:13:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.55,0:13:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every\Nsecond you stay here,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.62,0:13:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your odds get\Nworse and worse!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Pirate Island after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.70,0:13:43.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna keep comin'\Ntill you're "full-a-lead"!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.27,0:14:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it slow. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.77,0:14:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is Koby? Please\Ntell me he made it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.92,0:14:08.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I caused you\Nall so much trouble. Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.96,0:14:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be with us soon.\NAnd you're never trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain! We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you\Nsee in the papers
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.71,0:14:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is "Blackbeard this"\Nand "Blackbeard that."
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,526)}Well, meow you'll\Nsee what I can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.23,0:14:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a sneak preview\Nof tomorrow's big news story!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The famous Vice\NAdmiral Garp
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,led a team of promising\Nyoung elites
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.90,0:14:47.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in an attack on Pirate Island!"
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.44,0:14:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They attempted\Nto rescue Captain Koby,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the hero of the Navy!"
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"But then the Fourth\NShip Captain
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.77,0:15:28.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the Blackbeard Pirates struck\Nand they bowed before him!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.69,0:15:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Great Avalo Pizarro\Nproved far too mighty!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.08,0:15:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And all of those poor,\Nbrave Marines
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.60,0:15:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were completely annihilated"!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, please!\NDon't do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are civilians on board!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.94,0:15:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those people aren't\Nyour enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Koby.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.62,0:16:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Justice will prevail!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.65,0:16:17.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Walk faster!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.12,0:16:24.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do\Nthis! Please, let us go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're taking us\Nto Pirate Island, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you\Ngonna do to us?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.00,0:16:35.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't think Rayleigh would stick\Nhis nose in my business.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.95,0:16:39.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But I got some nice\Nsouvenirs, so who cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.53,0:16:44.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral,\Nthey're our comrades!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't we do anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.27,0:16:47.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We're\Nletting our men down.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.43,0:16:50.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We need\Npermission from above.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard is an Emperor.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.63,0:16:53.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.62,0:17:11.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, Captain\NKoby is with SWORD.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.65,0:17:13.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,SWORD, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.56,0:17:16.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Koby the Hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.32,0:17:20.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So what, y'come here\Nto take your friends back?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.48,0:17:24.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to start an all-out war,\Nthat's just peachy with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're capturing 800 Marines
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.45,0:17:29.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,and also commandeering\None of our warships, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.80,0:17:34.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them go. And you\Ncan take me instead.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You think pretty highly\Nof yourself, don't you, kid?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But your life is worth it.\NYou got a deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is this even real?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.33,0:18:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's too huge!\NWe can't fight that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.38,0:18:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?\NYou're kiddin' me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.35,0:18:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use. It isn't stopping!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.51,0:18:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to pull away.\NMove the ship back!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.82,0:18:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NNot on my watch!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.18,0:18:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can still reach us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.72,0:18:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that hand comes\Ndown on them,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.72,0:18:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hundreds of soldiers\Nand civilians will die!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.71,0:18:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't fight it! Where\Nwould we even start?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.06,0:19:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call everyone up to the deck!\NPrepare to abandon ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.04,0:19:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the civilians safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.14,0:19:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is going\Nto die because of me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I surrendered myself\Nto protect my comrades.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.99,0:19:19.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But all I've done is put\Nmore people in danger!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't protect anyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.86,0:19:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.13,0:19:46.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can save them.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.95,0:19:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll create\Nan opening for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.63,0:20:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, Captain Koby,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.97,0:20:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you climb up to that big rock\Nbastard's hand and destroy it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.31,0:20:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? But how\Ncan I do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.11,0:20:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral Grus,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.02,0:20:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when pieces of the hand fall\Ndown, you protect the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.31,0:20:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Commander\NHelmeppo,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.97,0:20:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,don't let anyone\Nstand in their way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.39,0:20:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I can try.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.69,0:20:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, wait!\NWhat if I can't...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.44,0:20:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hesitation\Nmeans defeat!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.38,0:20:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.07,0:20:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby and the others\Nare on the move!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.95,0:20:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.28,0:21:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without Garp, you're all\Ngoing straight into the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.46,0:21:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.59,0:21:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo! Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why me?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because those\Nwere your orders!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.73,0:21:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, then. But I don't like it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.14,0:21:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,147)}Let's see what you've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.11,0:21:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.53,0:21:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of pirates!\NUh, one at a time, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.91,0:21:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Koby.\NWhat's the plan here?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.44,0:21:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a bomb\Nor something?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.20,0:21:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.60,0:21:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to play\Nit by ear for now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, "play it by ear"?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't just "play it by ear"\Nfighting something big enough
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to crush a damn warship!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.41,0:21:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.64,0:21:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burn in hell, Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant\NCommander Helmeppo,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.03,0:21:49.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,don't let anyone\Nstand in their way.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.49,0:21:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest...\Nis up to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.52,0:22:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.92,0:22:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! Just go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(631.5,1053)}– But I...!\N– You have a job to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd sit back\Ndown if I were you, Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.31,0:22:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep movin'\Nand you'll bleed out.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is just\Na scratch.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.44,0:22:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm tryin'\Nto spare your life.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.73,0:22:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds soft to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.17,0:22:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.97,0:23:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Garp!\NWhat're you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.14,0:23:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't you care\Nwhat'll happen to the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.69,0:23:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Galaxy... Divide!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened?\NIt's pulling back!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.57,0:23:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is your opening, huh?\NThe arm went up. What now, Koby?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.65,0:24:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Here I go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.28,0:24:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.58,0:24:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh,\Nmeow you've done it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.29,0:24:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think\Nthat's enough to stop me?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.32,0:24:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! I'll make you pay! Stand\Nback and watch me do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll send your men\Nto their graves!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.26,0:24:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing\Nyou can do about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.43,0:24:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's back. Take cover!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.28,0:24:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can cry all you\Nlike, but we've already won!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.00,0:24:40.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Helmeppo.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.62,0:24:42.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby's making good progress,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.54,0:24:45.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,but why the hell's\Nhe always injured?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.56,0:24:46.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You\Nnoticed, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.91,0:24:52.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, well... He said not to tell\Nyou, but I guess I'd better.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.36,0:25:02.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't fight as\Nwell as everyone else,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.61,0:25:05.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,even if I train ten times\Nas much as them.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.28,0:25:08.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'll train a hundred...\Nno, 200 times harder!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.65,0:25:11.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes to be\Na proper Marine to help people,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.77,0:25:14.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,then I'll do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.42,0:25:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!\NDon't be stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.99,0:25:27.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna\Ndestroy yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.37,0:25:28.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're telling me
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.83,0:25:32.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,he's been training by\Nhimself on top of my drills?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.25,0:25:35.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1022)}Yes, sir. He's been\Npunching the Battleship Bag,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.47,0:25:38.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1022)}every single night.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he comes back\Nwith his fists covered in blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.95,0:26:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faster! Go faster!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.08,0:26:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3397,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}I have to make it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.37,0:26:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.33,0:26:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on. That's Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he really trying\Nto stop the hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.86,0:26:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get crushed!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.46,0:26:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know they call him\Na hero, but look!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.58,0:26:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next to Pizarro, the kid\Nis like the size of an ant!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.18,0:26:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby, why?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.78,0:26:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just protect yourself!\NDon't worry about us!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.62,0:26:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away! Go back!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.37,0:26:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koby! You made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.01,0:26:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got a front row seat\Nto the death of all your friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.66,0:26:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if they dive into the sea,\NAokiji will freeze them solid!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.08,0:26:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to take\Nout the kitty litter!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.43,0:27:02.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's lives\Nare depending on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.33,0:27:09.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to destroy it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.28,0:27:12.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,728)}If I don't, they'll all die!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.43,0:27:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't fight as well\Nas everyone else,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.11,0:27:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even if I train ten\Ntimes as hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.01,0:27:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I trained\Na hundred...200 times harder!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.57,0:27:33.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something out\Nthere worth protecting, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.56,0:27:35.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So what is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.77,0:27:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.05,0:27:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late! Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.24,0:27:45.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,526)}You can save them.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.36,0:28:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Honesty Impact!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.22,0:28:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, Koby. What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.44,0:28:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.43,0:28:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not yet! There's\Ntoo much debris!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.03,0:28:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here!\NGlorp Web!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.04,0:29:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.45,0:29:08.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.04,0:29:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby! I don't even\Nknow what to say!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.21,0:29:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Helmeppo. I did it.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.67,0:29:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you did, buddy!\NYou were amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.05,0:29:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at you,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.42,0:29:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,strong enough to bring\Ndown a mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.82,0:29:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, you maniac!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.19,0:29:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.71,0:29:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.19,0:29:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome\Nback, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.57,0:29:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby, you're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.07,0:29:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hibari.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.66,0:30:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're okay.\NWe're all going home.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.09,0:30:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Once Garp is\Nback, we'll take off.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.57,0:30:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cu-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.77,0:30:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Garp.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.93,0:30:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mission to rescue\NCaptain Koby is a success.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.10,0:30:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral. You're all right!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.21,0:30:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry back to the ship\Nand we'll leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.80,0:30:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually... depart\Nfrom Fullalead immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.45,0:30:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.03,0:30:34.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.22,0:30:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, what are\Nyou talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.26,0:30:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry\Nabout this old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.92,0:30:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our top priority in this mission
Dialogue: 50,0:30:40.58,0:30:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is the safety of everyone\Non that ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.17,0:30:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.43,0:30:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't go.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.59,0:30:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Turn the ship around!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.59,0:30:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've won\Nthe battle today.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.13,0:31:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our victory sends\Na message to all pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.54,0:31:07.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Please you have to let\Nme join the Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.22,0:31:09.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll clean and scrub and do any\Nchores that you'd like me to.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.96,0:31:12.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything\Nto become a Marine.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.91,0:31:16.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you boys\Njoin the Navy to protect?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.05,0:31:18.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.12,0:31:21.20,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the future of all\Npeople, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.51,0:31:24.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be part of that\Nfuture for years to come,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,long after the old man's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.66,0:31:33.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that baby and go.\NLive your lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.00,0:31:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep going.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.41,0:31:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all are the future\Nof the Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.80,0:31:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ca-lick.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:09.49,0:32:10.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What\Nwere you thinking?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.06,0:32:13.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,In the future, will you please\Nlimit the tasteless lectures
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.60,0:32:15.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,in front of the young recruits?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.36,0:32:19.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Why should I, when young\Npeople's future is limitless?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.25,0:32:34.67,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The next day,\Nnewspapers reported
Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.67,0:32:38.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the heroic rescue of the Navy's\Nyoung hero, Captain Koby.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.92,0:32:42.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Along with the sorrowful\Nnews that Vice Admiral Garp
Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.38,0:32:45.84,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,disappeared after\Nhis battle on Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.84,0:32:49.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It was also reported that\Nthe Emperor of the Sea,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.06,0:32:51.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy,\Nhad barricaded himself
Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.98,0:32:55.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,on the Future\NIsland, Egghead.
